{#
| Variable                     | Type    | Description                                        |
|------------------------------|---------|----------------------------------------------------|
| component.slides             | array   | one entry per banner: image, text, button, position |
| component.transition         | string  | slide \| fade                                       |
| component.autoplay           | bool    | advance on a timer                                  |
| component.autoplay_seconds   | int     | seconds per banner                                  |
| component.loop               | bool    | wrap from the last banner back to the first         |
| component.default_slide      | int     | 1-based index of the banner shown first             |
| component.show_arrows/dots   | bool    | navigation chrome                                   |
| component.font_family        | string  | theme font, a Google family, or `custom`            |
| component.font_google        | string  | Google family name when font_family = custom        |
| component.font_url           | string  | direct .woff2 URL — wins over font_google           |
| component.title_size         | int     | desktop title size in px                            |
| component.fixed_height/height/focus | mixed | uniform-height mode (crops, focus picks what stays) |

Qissa banners — one or more full-image banners in a swipeable slider.

SIZING. The image sizes its own card: it is a normal flow item, so the banner
is exactly as tall as the artwork and nothing letterboxes. With several slides
they must share ONE height or the block would jump on every transition, so the
tallest slide sets it (the others are absolutely positioned over that). Fixed
mode instead pins a height and crops, with `focus` choosing what survives.

TEXT ABOVE BUTTON, ALWAYS. The content stack is a column: title, subtitle, then
the CTA — the merchant picks WHERE the stack sits, never the order inside it.

FONTS. Salla theme fields cannot upload a font file (there is no file format,
only `image`), so custom fonts arrive one of two ways: a Google family name,
which is fetched from fonts.googleapis.com, or a direct .woff2 URL the merchant
hosts, which is registered with an inline @font-face. The URL wins when both
are set.

The overlay grid runs LTR on purpose: postcss-preset-env downlevels logical
properties assuming LTR, so "يمين/يسار" map to physical right/left in CSS. The
content re-isolates its own RTL for the Arabic text.
#}

{# Built with a loop, not |filter(s => s.image): `map` with an arrow function
   has precedent in this theme but `filter` does not, and an unsupported Twig
   construct blanks the entire block silently rather than erroring. #}
{% set slides = [] %}
{% for s in component.slides|default([]) %}
    {% if s.image %}{% set slides = slides|merge([s]) %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if slides|length %}

    {% set fixed = component.fixed_height %}
    {% set transition = component.transition is iterable ? component.transition|first : component.transition %}
    {% set transition = transition.value|default(transition)|default('slide') %}

    {% set focus_raw = component.focus is iterable ? component.focus|first : component.focus %}
    {% set focus = focus_raw.value|default(focus_raw)|default('center') %}

    {# ---- typography -------------------------------------------------- #}
    {% set fam_raw = component.font_family is iterable ? component.font_family|first : component.font_family %}
    {% set fam = fam_raw.value|default(fam_raw)|default('GE SS Two') %}
    {% set google = '' %}
    {% set stack = "'GE SS Two', sans-serif" %}

    {% if fam == 'custom' %}
        {% if component.font_url %}
            {% set stack = "'qib-custom', 'GE SS Two', sans-serif" %}
        {% elseif component.font_google %}
            {% set google = component.font_google %}
            {% set stack = "'" ~ google ~ "', 'GE SS Two', sans-serif" %}
        {% endif %}
    {% elseif fam == 'inherit' %}
        {% set stack = 'inherit' %}
    {% elseif fam != 'GE SS Two' %}
        {% set google = fam %}
        {% set stack = "'" ~ fam ~ "', 'GE SS Two', sans-serif" %}
    {% endif %}

    {% set css = '--qib-font: ' ~ stack ~ ';'
               ~ '--qib-title: ' ~ component.title_size|default(44) ~ 'px;' %}
    {% if fixed %}
        {% set h = component.height|default(560) %}
        {% set css = css ~ '--qib-height: ' ~ h ~ 'px;'
                   ~ '--qib-height-md: ' ~ (h * 0.82)|round ~ 'px;'
                   ~ '--qib-height-sm: ' ~ (h * 0.68)|round ~ 'px;'
                   ~ '--qib-focus: ' ~ focus ~ ';' %}
    {% endif %}

    {% if google %}
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
        <link rel="stylesheet"
              href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family={{ google|replace({' ': '+'}) }}:wght@400;700&display=swap">
    {% elseif fam == 'custom' and component.font_url %}
        <style>
            @font-face {
                font-family: 'qib-custom';
                src: url('{{ component.font_url }}') format('woff2');
                font-display: swap;
            }
        </style>
    {% endif %}

    {% set start = component.default_slide|default(1) %}
    {% set start = start > slides|length ? 1 : start %}

    <section class="s-block qibanner{{ fixed ? ' qibanner--fixed' : '' }} qibanner--{{ transition }}{{ slides|length > 1 ? ' qibanner--multi' : '' }}"
             id="qibanner-{{ position }}"
             style="{{ css }}"
             data-qib
             {% if slides|length > 1 %}
                 data-qib-start="{{ start - 1 }}"
                 data-qib-loop="{{ component.loop|default(true) ? '1' : '0' }}"
                 {% if component.autoplay %}data-qib-autoplay="{{ component.autoplay_seconds|default(5) }}"{% endif %}
             {% endif %}>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="qibanner__viewport">
                <div class="qibanner__track" data-qib-track>
                    {% for slide in slides %}
                        {% set pos_raw = slide.content_position is iterable ? slide.content_position|first : slide.content_position %}
                        {% set pos = pos_raw.value|default(pos_raw)|default('bottom-center') %}
                        {% set ov_raw = slide.overlay is iterable ? slide.overlay|first : slide.overlay %}
                        {% set ov = ov_raw.value|default(ov_raw)|default('light') %}

                        <div class="qibanner__slide{{ loop.index0 == (start - 1) ? ' is-active' : '' }}"
                             data-qib-slide="{{ loop.index0 }}"
                             {% if loop.index0 != (start - 1) %}aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>

                            {# <picture> so a phone downloads only the mobile file #}
                            <picture>
                                {% if slide.image_mobile %}
                                    <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="{{ slide.image_mobile }}"/>
                                {% endif %}
                                <img class="qibanner__img"
                                     src="{{ slide.image }}"
                                     alt="{{ slide.alt|default(slide.title)|default('') }}"
                                     {% if loop.index0 == (start - 1) %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}/>
                            </picture>

                            {% if ov != 'none' %}
                                <span class="qibanner__scrim" data-ov="{{ ov }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            {% endif %}

                            {% if slide.title or slide.subtitle or (slide.button_text and slide.button_url) %}
                                {# column: title, subtitle, THEN the button — the merchant
                                   places the stack, never reorders what is inside it #}
                                <div class="qibanner__overlay" data-pos="{{ pos }}">
                                    <div class="qibanner__content"
                                         {% if slide.text_color %}style="--qib-ink: {{ slide.text_color }}"{% endif %}>
                                        {% if slide.title %}<h2 class="qibanner__title">{{ slide.title }}</h2>{% endif %}
                                        {% if slide.subtitle %}<p class="qibanner__sub">{{ slide.subtitle }}</p>{% endif %}
                                        {% if slide.button_text and slide.button_url %}
                                            <a class="qibanner__btn" href="{{ slide.button_url }}">{{ slide.button_text }}</a>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>

                {% if slides|length > 1 and component.show_arrows|default(true) %}
                    <button type="button" class="qibanner__arrow qibanner__arrow--prev" data-qib-prev
                            aria-label="{{ trans('blocks.qissa.prev')|default('السابق') }}">
                        <i class="sicon-arrow-right"></i>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="qibanner__arrow qibanner__arrow--next" data-qib-next
                            aria-label="{{ trans('blocks.qissa.next')|default('التالي') }}">
                        <i class="sicon-arrow-left"></i>
                    </button>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            {% if slides|length > 1 and component.show_dots|default(true) %}
                <div class="qibanner__dots" data-qib-dots>
                    {% for slide in slides %}
                        <button type="button"
                                class="qibanner__dot{{ loop.index0 == (start - 1) ? ' is-active' : '' }}"
                                data-qib-dot="{{ loop.index0 }}"
                                aria-label="{{ loop.index }}"></button>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </section>
{% endif %}
